.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem

# Backup archive — deliberately excluded.
# The reassembled tarball is ~245 MB, well past GitHub's 100 MB per-file
# limit; committing it would fail the push. Extract it and commit the
# contents instead. See RESTORE.md.
part-*
project.tar.gz

